  m_text: '<b><color=#56CCF2>WHAT YOU WILL DO</color></b>


    1. Enters Na<sub>2</sub>S<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>
    and water volumes.

    2. Add the fixed H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> volume and
    start the reaction.

